::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: door-unlisted fixture ]

==[ file-io ]

@rule(file-io){
  guard: { twrit: door }

  door: {
    names: list("std::fs")
    allowed: list("reader")
  }
}

`reader` is the door. `other` is not on the list and reads a file anyway,
which is the case a prose "the only place" cannot report.
